Uploading a video

The `Uploader` sends a file to `Storage`. `Storage` tells the `Transcoder`,
which writes three renditions back to `Storage`. The `Player` streams from the
`CDN`, and the `CDN` pulls from `Storage`.
---
Uploader -> Storage: upload
Storage -> Transcoder: new file
Transcoder -> Storage: renditions
Player -> CDN: stream
CDN -> Storage: pull
